# Antigravity handoff (Cursor Cloud)

- **Cannot** remote-login to the user's Antigravity IDE. Use **git handoff files** instead.
- To assign HISE work: run `./scripts/antigravity-bridge/antigravity-bridge.sh send --wo ... --title ... --push`
- Inbox: `disklordz/antigravity/inbox/` · Outbox: `outbox/`
- Docs: `disklordz/antigravity/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/HISE_ANTIGRAVITY_LANE.md`
